    "howItWorks": "Amaranth is a high-fidelity granular synthesizer and sound-design delay. It continuously buffers the incoming stereo signal and triggers up to 128 overlapping grains with custom grain sizes, pitch-shifts, feedback, and user-drawn coordinate envelopes.",
