    "packRequired": "Saike Tools (Joep Vanlier)",
    "howItWorks": "Ripple is a high-precision tremolo, auto-panner, and volume gate that uses custom LFO waveforms, multi-phase offsets, and host BPM synchronization to create rhythmic stereo panning.",
