    "packRequired": "Saike Tools (Joep Vanlier)",
    "howItWorks": "Satan Verb is an aggressive, dark, and massive algorithmic reverb featuring a feedback loop driven by extreme saturation and non-linear waveshaping, designed to build massive wall-of-sound tails.",
    "proTips": "Not for the faint of heart! Excellent for industrial techno, drone music, or heavy sound design. Turn up the decay and distortion to create massive, grinding metallic textures."
