    "howItWorks": "Swellotron is an automatic volume sweller and ambient pad generator. It continuously detects transient onsets in the incoming signal and automatically suppresses them, fading in slow-attack tails for a violin-like effect.",
    "proTips": "Ideal for acoustic guitars, electric guitars, or piano. It removes the sharp attack of the note and turns your chords into lush, sweeping pads automatically."
